            "category": "description",
            "text": "A flaw was found in SVGO, an SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) Optimizer. This vulnerability allows a remote attacker to cause a Denial of Service (DoS) by submitting a specially crafted XML file. The application's failure to properly guard against XML entity expansion or recursion can lead to the Node.js process consuming excessive memory and crashing.",
